(1073108, 129632, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the girl (very photogenic), especially nice black and white.  But the cat doesn''t seem to be a good color for this conversion--it seems to lack sufficient contrast.  Even parts of it that should be dark, like its nose!  The background works mostly, but it would have been nice to avoid the vertical and the edge of something creeping just above her hairline on her left.</td>', 'Great shot of the girl (very photogenic), especially nice black and white.  But the cat doesn''t seem to be a good color for this conversion--it seems to lack sufficient contrast.  Even parts of it that should be dark, like its nose!  The background works mostly, but it would have been nice to avoid the vertical and the edge of something creeping just above her hairline on her left.', '2004-12-22 00:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1073113, 129709, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good action shot and exposure of the bird, but the scene makes it look too much like a snapshot.  On a studio like background (and maybe with the babies eyes open) this could have been a winner!</td>', 'Very good action shot and exposure of the bird, but the scene makes it look too much like a snapshot.  On a studio like background (and maybe with the babies eyes open) this could have been a winner!', '2004-12-22 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
