(1073234, 129344, 12253, '<td valign="top">The image you''ve captured here is perfect--and wonderful.  There seems to be some quality issues with resolution or noise, but the image is too good to let that stop you!  I think this should ribbon.</td>', 'The image you''ve captured here is perfect--and wonderful.  There seems to be some quality issues with resolution or noise, but the image is too good to let that stop you!  I think this should ribbon.', '2004-12-22 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1073236, 128807, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  One of my favorites for the challenge, but this makes the fourth  i''ve predicted should win, so I guess I''ll be wrong on some ;)  I think it might have been nice to crop the top a bit, to just over her head.  The blue is a bit overwhelming on the subjects.</td>', 'Great capture.  One of my favorites for the challenge, but this makes the fourth  i''ve predicted should win, so I guess I''ll be wrong on some ;)  I think it might have been nice to crop the top a bit, to just over her head.  The blue is a bit overwhelming on the subjects.', '2004-12-22 01:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
