(1073283, 129112, 16648, '<td valign="top">Horse is underexposed, the sky is too bright. Unless it adds to the composition, remove it - so what is the wooded step thing for? behind the person is a bright blue thing...there is a pole growing from the horses withers...the jump standards are framing hte handler''s head...the whip''s end is hanging loose and bright red....<br/> <br/>Lots to fix. easy to fix too - take your time when composing a shot. try several exposures to get it all right or at least have options at edit time. Try another angle - stand onthe fence and shoot down to get teh sky out of the pic, or use a barn or horse trailer as a backdrop.</td>', 'Horse is underexposed, the sky is too bright. Unless it adds to the composition, remove it - so what is the wooded step thing for? behind the person is a bright blue thing...there is a pole growing from the horses withers...the jump standards are framing hte handler''s head...the whip''s end is hanging loose and bright red.... Lots to fix. easy to fix too - take your time when composing a shot. try several exposures to get it all right or at least have options at edit time. Try another angle - stand onthe fence and shoot down to get teh sky out of the pic, or use a barn or horse trailer as a backdrop.', '2004-12-22 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
