(1074513, 129631, 6132, '<td valign="top">Love it! You''ve done a marvelous job in capturing the sense of apprehension and eagerness that most dogs endure when their owners are away. The black and white works really well and adds a deserted and companionless mood. There seems to be talk on the boards during this challenge about most images for this challenge being nothing more than emotionless snap-shots. Yet I really do feel this image has proved them all wrong. You''ve done an excellent job, Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Love it! You''ve done a marvelous job in capturing the sense of apprehension and eagerness that most dogs endure when their owners are away. The black and white works really well and adds a deserted and companionless mood. There seems to be talk on the boards during this challenge about most images for this challenge being nothing more than emotionless snap-shots. Yet I really do feel this image has proved them all wrong. You''ve done an excellent job, Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-12-22 17:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
