(1074627, 129941, 1875, '<td valign="top">Holy guacomole! Now that''s what I call bravery... it''s in a house... please tell me it''s not alive</td>', 'Holy guacomole! Now that''s what I call bravery... it''s in a house... please tell me it''s not alive', '2004-12-22 18:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
