(1074634, 129714, 1875, '<td valign="top">And each one a handful I''m sure! cute pic!</td>', 'And each one a handful I''m sure! cute pic!', '2004-12-22 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074642, 129299, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a sweet candid-style image. I really like the way in which the girl is so relaxed and comfortable and the dog is perched upon her. It clearly shows a bond that is familiar and warm. The choice for black and white is good as it let''s the focus remain on the eyes of both rather than on the furniture. Background is reduced in impact by being black and white which is a good thing in my opinion. That said, whilst this is a lovely picture, like most in the challenge, for ME it''s one that will always hold more interest for those who know the subjects than it will for strangers.</td>', 'What a sweet candid-style image. I really like the way in which the girl is so relaxed and comfortable and the dog is perched upon her. It clearly shows a bond that is familiar and warm. The choice for black and white is good as it let''s the focus remain on the eyes of both rather than on the furniture. Background is reduced in impact by being black and white which is a good thing in my opinion. That said, whilst this is a lovely picture, like most in the challenge, for ME it''s one that will always hold more interest for those who know the subjects than it will for strangers.', '2004-12-22 19:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074653, 129341, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice in my book....  nice tone, like the composition and perspective.  Worthy of a ribbon.</td>', 'Very nice in my book....  nice tone, like the composition and perspective.  Worthy of a ribbon.', '2004-12-22 19:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074655, 129939, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice idea... bright area in upper right is distracting..... not a very cute cat (in my opinion).</td>', 'Nice idea... bright area in upper right is distracting..... not a very cute cat (in my opinion).', '2004-12-22 19:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074674, 129963, 6600, '<td valign="top">Black and white works nicely here, nice crop.  Obvious distress in womens face (I hope it was an act), very convincing.  Ribbon worthy.</td>', 'Black and white works nicely here, nice crop.  Obvious distress in womens face (I hope it was an act), very convincing.  Ribbon worthy.', '2004-12-22 19:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074712, 129777, 29777, '<td valign="top">The bird seems more scared than affectionate. Blurry, out of focus, muted color, bad lighting. Sorry, this needs some work.</td>', 'The bird seems more scared than affectionate. Blurry, out of focus, muted color, bad lighting. Sorry, this needs some work.', '2004-12-22 20:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
