(1074771, 129947, 1368, '<td valign="top">Oh thats really a sad picture and it brings up a lot of emotions I also had a wonderful  cat  who lived  1987-2003 just as penny And I miss him every day :(<br/>But I guess Penny was a dog<br/>Anyway thanks for sharing</td>', 'Oh thats really a sad picture and it brings up a lot of emotions I also had a wonderful  cat  who lived  1987-2003 just as penny And I miss him every day :(But I guess Penny was a dogAnyway thanks for sharing', '2004-12-22 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
