(1074799, 129815, 18799, '<td valign="top">The color is off, there is too much negative space, the border is distracting, and it is out of focus.  It''s almost a parody.  If this was intentional, then it worked.  If not, then there are a few things you need to work on.  Sorry.</td>', 'The color is off, there is too much negative space, the border is distracting, and it is out of focus.  It''s almost a parody.  If this was intentional, then it worked.  If not, then there are a few things you need to work on.  Sorry.', '2004-12-22 21:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074805, 129934, 18799, '<td valign="top">Condro?, or emerald? - I always have a hard time with that.   The fact that it''s on a hook makes me think emerald &lt;g&gt;.  The DOF is too shallow for my tastes.  I would have like to have seen the snake hanging more vertical.</td>', 'Condro?, or emerald? - I always have a hard time with that.   The fact that it''s on a hook makes me think emerald <g>.  The DOF is too shallow for my tastes.  I would have like to have seen the snake hanging more vertical.', '2004-12-22 21:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
