(1074917, 129754, 22010, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Only problem is that there is no person. Without context, this doesn''t fit the challenge. It would fit a pets challenge just fine though! Cute cat.</td>', 'Great picture. Only problem is that there is no person. Without context, this doesn''t fit the challenge. It would fit a pets challenge just fine though! Cute cat.', '2004-12-22 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
