(1074940, 129206, 22479, '<td valign="top">Priceless moment. This fits the challenge about as perfectly as I can imagine. Lighting was not quite well handled here, a bit harsh as it seems the majority of the lighting was a fill flash emitted by the camera. Still, an excellent entry.</td>', 'Priceless moment. This fits the challenge about as perfectly as I can imagine. Lighting was not quite well handled here, a bit harsh as it seems the majority of the lighting was a fill flash emitted by the camera. Still, an excellent entry.', '2004-12-23 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074942, 129941, 12253, '<td valign="top">Crikey, now there''s a cuddly pet!  Is it stuffed or live?  And I wondered why people have pitbulls!  This guy would have a pit bull for lunch.  But your house doesn''t look like a good environment to keep a gator.  Good capture, though it would have been better to isolate the subjects from the background a bit more.</td>', 'Crikey, now there''s a cuddly pet!  Is it stuffed or live?  And I wondered why people have pitbulls!  This guy would have a pit bull for lunch.  But your house doesn''t look like a good environment to keep a gator.  Good capture, though it would have been better to isolate the subjects from the background a bit more.', '2004-12-23 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074944, 129510, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nothing like the love a child has for a pet!  Good capture, good contrasts.  A few small issues with clarity and flash reflectiosn (all along her shirt for example).</td>', 'Nothing like the love a child has for a pet!  Good capture, good contrasts.  A few small issues with clarity and flash reflectiosn (all along her shirt for example).', '2004-12-23 00:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074945, 129033, 12253, '<td valign="top">That''s one spoiled keet.  It''s a good shot from the point of view of showing the keet in the cage, and to some extent, the girl, but if the bird comes out, I think that might have been a better shot.  I''ve had numerous keets over the years and they are great!</td>', 'That''s one spoiled keet.  It''s a good shot from the point of view of showing the keet in the cage, and to some extent, the girl, but if the bird comes out, I think that might have been a better shot.  I''ve had numerous keets over the years and they are great!', '2004-12-23 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074948, 129915, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good capture, a nice soft light and good composition.  A little light or catchlights in the persons eyes would have made it a bit better.</td>', 'Very good capture, a nice soft light and good composition.  A little light or catchlights in the persons eyes would have made it a bit better.', '2004-12-23 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074950, 128825, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea/way to juxtapose people and their pet fish!</td>', 'Good idea/way to juxtapose people and their pet fish!', '2004-12-23 00:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074962, 129164, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Very sharp, colors well balanced. I don''t mind this type of border, but you should have created an equal width, uniform border. The inner blue border is not of uniform width...the top side is one pixel thinner than the sides and bottom. A photoshop trick that many people use is to select the appropriate background color and increase the canvas size by the width you want the border to be. In this case, you could have first selected blue, then increased the canvas size by 3 pixels all around. Then select white, and again increase border by increasing the canvas size.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Very sharp, colors well balanced. I don''t mind this type of border, but you should have created an equal width, uniform border. The inner blue border is not of uniform width...the top side is one pixel thinner than the sides and bottom. A photoshop trick that many people use is to select the appropriate background color and increase the canvas size by the width you want the border to be. In this case, you could have first selected blue, then increased the canvas size by 3 pixels all around. Then select white, and again increase border by increasing the canvas size.', '2004-12-23 00:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074969, 129368, 22479, '<td valign="top">Studio light in the photo...intentional I imagine. Perhaps child is using time between shoots to catch up on his favorite book. In any event, excellent lighting and other technical aspects (i.e. exposure, focus, DOF, detail) well handled. Colors are a little bit muted. A quick boost in saturation could have cured that.</td>', 'Studio light in the photo...intentional I imagine. Perhaps child is using time between shoots to catch up on his favorite book. In any event, excellent lighting and other technical aspects (i.e. exposure, focus, DOF, detail) well handled. Colors are a little bit muted. A quick boost in saturation could have cured that.', '2004-12-23 01:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074972, 129754, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is unfair. This kitten wins the blue ribbon for ''cutest animal in contest''. Oh, by the way, this is my top pick for the ribbon. Well done! 10</td>', 'This is unfair. This kitten wins the blue ribbon for ''cutest animal in contest''. Oh, by the way, this is my top pick for the ribbon. Well done! 10', '2004-12-23 01:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074973, 129915, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, focus, DOF, and contrast. I like the way you framed this shot.</td>', 'Excellent exposure, focus, DOF, and contrast. I like the way you framed this shot.', '2004-12-23 01:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074974, 129026, 18461, '<td valign="top">I love the shot but the trashcan and crates are distracting.</td>', 'I love the shot but the trashcan and crates are distracting.', '2004-12-23 01:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074977, 128719, 22479, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent. Fantastic details brought out in this shot. I like the crop and the angle. I imagine this should do quite well. Well done!</td>', 'Technically excellent. Fantastic details brought out in this shot. I like the crop and the angle. I imagine this should do quite well. Well done!', '2004-12-23 01:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074978, 128771, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot on artistic and technical merits. Excellent detail and the expression on the child and chihuahua match very well. Quite a feat.</td>', 'Excellent shot on artistic and technical merits. Excellent detail and the expression on the child and chihuahua match very well. Quite a feat.', '2004-12-23 01:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074979, 129962, 22479, '<td valign="top">Feisty kitten. I think you captured the moment perfectly! This is one of my top picks this week. Well done.</td>', 'Feisty kitten. I think you captured the moment perfectly! This is one of my top picks this week. Well done.', '2004-12-23 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074980, 129830, 18461, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot but I think black and white would havebeen more effective.</td>', 'Really nice shot but I think black and white would havebeen more effective.', '2004-12-23 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074981, 129010, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this image has fantastic lighting, exposure, focus, sharpness, DOF, and tonal range. Basically, technical aspects beyond reproach. Artistically well composed too. Certainly one of my top picks for this challenge. Well done!</td>', 'I think this image has fantastic lighting, exposure, focus, sharpness, DOF, and tonal range. Basically, technical aspects beyond reproach. Artistically well composed too. Certainly one of my top picks for this challenge. Well done!', '2004-12-23 01:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074982, 129934, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fantastic DOF. I think you captured this one perfectly. No recommendations for improvement.</td>', 'Fantastic DOF. I think you captured this one perfectly. No recommendations for improvement.', '2004-12-23 01:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074983, 129728, 22479, '<td valign="top">Just a tad bit overexposed in the fur but does not detract from the beauty of this image. I think the B&amp;W approach is well suited here.</td>', 'Just a tad bit overexposed in the fur but does not detract from the beauty of this image. I think the B&W approach is well suited here.', '2004-12-23 01:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074984, 129516, 22479, '<td valign="top">Eyes are very expressive here. Well matched in both subjects, which is what I feel you were trying to achieve here. Technical aspects beyond reproach. Well framed, overall excellent!</td>', 'Eyes are very expressive here. Well matched in both subjects, which is what I feel you were trying to achieve here. Technical aspects beyond reproach. Well framed, overall excellent!', '2004-12-23 01:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074985, 129299, 22479, '<td valign="top">Excellent with the B&amp;W approach. Great contrast and tonal range. Excellent sharpness and focus. Best part of the photograph is the expression on the puppy, quite priceless.</td>', 'Excellent with the B&W approach. Great contrast and tonal range. Excellent sharpness and focus. Best part of the photograph is the expression on the puppy, quite priceless.', '2004-12-23 01:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074986, 129953, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting choice here works very well, and the B&amp;W approach is quite appropriate. There appears to be some grain in this image, which does not detract enough to be an issue. This image could have been improved with a boost in shadow levels but given the amount of grain, I can understand your choice in leaving the exposure levels where they are. Overall well executed.</td>', 'I think the lighting choice here works very well, and the B&W approach is quite appropriate. There appears to be some grain in this image, which does not detract enough to be an issue. This image could have been improved with a boost in shadow levels but given the amount of grain, I can understand your choice in leaving the exposure levels where they are. Overall well executed.', '2004-12-23 01:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074988, 128518, 5603, '<td valign="top">What the hell is this supposed to mean?</td>', 'What the hell is this supposed to mean?', '2004-12-23 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074989, 129867, 22479, '<td valign="top">with claws extended? Ouch! Well framed and interesting angle. Tad bit overexposed. Adequate sharpness but could be sharper. Overall the colors could be tweaked to tone down the redness of the face and overall warm cast cooled off a bit.</td>', 'with claws extended? Ouch! Well framed and interesting angle. Tad bit overexposed. Adequate sharpness but could be sharper. Overall the colors could be tweaked to tone down the redness of the face and overall warm cast cooled off a bit.', '2004-12-23 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074990, 129906, 18461, '<td valign="top">Love it but it''s a little too dark.</td>', 'Love it but it''s a little too dark.', '2004-12-23 01:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074991, 129929, 22479, '<td valign="top">High key exposure tastefully executed. Good tonal range. I like the expression on the dog and it''s quite fitting with the title. Well done.</td>', 'High key exposure tastefully executed. Good tonal range. I like the expression on the dog and it''s quite fitting with the title. Well done.', '2004-12-23 01:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074993, 129939, 22479, '<td valign="top">First off, I think this photo is one of the most creative of the bunch. How can it be improved? If the feline was looking to her right, as if interacting with the shadow.</td>', 'First off, I think this photo is one of the most creative of the bunch. How can it be improved? If the feline was looking to her right, as if interacting with the shadow.', '2004-12-23 01:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074997, 129341, 22479, '<td valign="top">Although this appears to be staged, it is a powerful image nonetheless. The dog is stoically by her master''s side, for better or for worse. Excellently composed.<br/> <br/>One suggestion for improvement. Care should be taken not to over sharpen as there are significant artifacts in the blades of the grass as well as the sign as a result of extreme edge sharpening.</td>', 'Although this appears to be staged, it is a powerful image nonetheless. The dog is stoically by her master''s side, for better or for worse. Excellently composed. One suggestion for improvement. Care should be taken not to over sharpen as there are significant artifacts in the blades of the grass as well as the sign as a result of extreme edge sharpening.', '2004-12-23 01:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074998, 128728, 22479, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is quite interesting. Toy figurines and their toy pets. Quite unique in this challenge. However, this photo doesn''t quite fit the challenge.</td>', 'Wow. This is quite interesting. Toy figurines and their toy pets. Quite unique in this challenge. However, this photo doesn''t quite fit the challenge.', '2004-12-23 01:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1074999, 129033, 5603, '<td valign="top">Rut roh!<br/></td>', 'Rut roh!', '2004-12-23 01:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075004, 129910, 22479, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from a lack of resolution which I suspect is more an issue with the hardware than the photographer. Consequently this image suffers from a lack of detail and sharpness. I think you had an interesting subject to begin with, and added a good title. The execution was hampered by technicalities inherent in your camera.</td>', 'This image suffers from a lack of resolution which I suspect is more an issue with the hardware than the photographer. Consequently this image suffers from a lack of detail and sharpness. I think you had an interesting subject to begin with, and added a good title. The execution was hampered by technicalities inherent in your camera.', '2004-12-23 01:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075008, 129777, 22479, '<td valign="top">...is worth two in the bush elsewhere. Here, it''ll score you poor I''m afraid. Camera''s autofocus can be quite quirky at times. In this instance, it appears that the focus was missing in action. I recommend taking a shot, quickly checking for the important issues: focus, exposure, color balance, and framing. Then reshoot as necessary. It''s a digital camera, there''s no reason to settle for a poorly executed shot. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure what resolution your camera is capable of. You should try to submit an image that is around 600-640 pixels on the long edge so you can take full advantage of the image size. This means that as long as you aren''t using a cheap webcam, or a sub-megapixel camera, you should not have trouble resizing your image to this size. I hope you do well in your future entries.</td>', '...is worth two in the bush elsewhere. Here, it''ll score you poor I''m afraid. Camera''s autofocus can be quite quirky at times. In this instance, it appears that the focus was missing in action. I recommend taking a shot, quickly checking for the important issues: focus, exposure, color balance, and framing. Then reshoot as necessary. It''s a digital camera, there''s no reason to settle for a poorly executed shot.  I''m not sure what resolution your camera is capable of. You should try to submit an image that is around 600-640 pixels on the long edge so you can take full advantage of the image size. This means that as long as you aren''t using a cheap webcam, or a sub-megapixel camera, you should not have trouble resizing your image to this size. I hope you do well in your future entries.', '2004-12-23 02:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075010, 129690, 22479, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you''re trying to do with this photograph. The fact that the dog is looking away doesn''t help. Lighting is too harsh on the fur and shadows too prominent, and the hand being in the shadows escapes attention, which judging from your title, is not a good thing.</td>', 'Not sure what you''re trying to do with this photograph. The fact that the dog is looking away doesn''t help. Lighting is too harsh on the fur and shadows too prominent, and the hand being in the shadows escapes attention, which judging from your title, is not a good thing.', '2004-12-23 02:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075011, 129825, 10658, '<td valign="top">There are only 2 pictures I consider 10''s (not that I''m an expert!) in this challenge, and this one is definitely one of them.  *Gorgeous*</td>', 'There are only 2 pictures I consider 10''s (not that I''m an expert!) in this challenge, and this one is definitely one of them.  *Gorgeous*', '2004-12-23 02:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075013, 128979, 22479, '<td valign="top">Is that a stuffed animal? It''s out of focus, which I fear was not your intention. Statue does not qualify here as a person which is the object of the pet''s affection, as the challenge rules mandate.</td>', 'Is that a stuffed animal? It''s out of focus, which I fear was not your intention. Statue does not qualify here as a person which is the object of the pet''s affection, as the challenge rules mandate.', '2004-12-23 02:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
