(1075556, 129645, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I like the soft focus. The lighting is well done, the important parts are well lit, the rest blends with the background. But you''ve got some <i>bad</i> jpeg artifarcts in there...Did you have to compress it that much?? 8.</td>', 'Nice picture. I like the soft focus. The lighting is well done, the important parts are well lit, the rest blends with the background. But you''ve got some bad jpeg artifarcts in there...Did you have to compress it that much?? 8.', '2004-12-23 17:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
