(1075700, 128540, 25218, '<td valign="top">Very sweet! But it doesn''t look like the cat is enjoying him/herself... but then do they ever look like they''re not bored? :) Focus is a little soft, and the composition is a little lacking, but the exposure looks very good. Great job!</td>', 'Very sweet! But it doesn''t look like the cat is enjoying him/herself... but then do they ever look like they''re not bored? :) Focus is a little soft, and the composition is a little lacking, but the exposure looks very good. Great job!', '2004-12-23 19:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075702, 129953, 25218, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting, but I don''t care for the background choice (personally, I always have trouble choosing a background). Great B/W photo.</td>', 'I really like the lighting, but I don''t care for the background choice (personally, I always have trouble choosing a background). Great B/W photo.', '2004-12-23 19:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075705, 129759, 25218, '<td valign="top">I just love dogs! And I really like the way you frame him/her with the wood piece. Did you use a flash? It kind of looks like it, because of the green of the eyes, and the reflections on the wood. If you did, maybe try the shot again with just natural lighting &amp; use a longer exposure w/tripod or rest it on something. I think it would make this good photo an excellent photo. And I think it would look even better in blk/wht. Great job!</td>', 'I just love dogs! And I really like the way you frame him/her with the wood piece. Did you use a flash? It kind of looks like it, because of the green of the eyes, and the reflections on the wood. If you did, maybe try the shot again with just natural lighting & use a longer exposure w/tripod or rest it on something. I think it would make this good photo an excellent photo. And I think it would look even better in blk/wht. Great job!', '2004-12-23 19:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1075726, 129934, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am not a big of snakes, but that one has great colors and cool patterns.  Interesting DOF.</td>', 'I am not a big of snakes, but that one has great colors and cool patterns.  Interesting DOF.', '2004-12-23 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
