(1076016, 129645, 12095, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  My pick for 1st and I believe it this will win 1st place. The black background with just the hand by the birds head is elegantly composed.</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  My pick for 1st and I believe it this will win 1st place. The black background with just the hand by the birds head is elegantly composed.', '2004-12-23 22:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
