(1076041, 129825, 21367, '<td valign="top">Awesome job.  Expressions, Tones and Lighting all perfect to set the mood.</td>', 'Awesome job.  Expressions, Tones and Lighting all perfect to set the mood.', '2004-12-23 23:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076048, 129033, 21367, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy picture...a tough one to shoot through the cage.  It appears that you may have used the on board flash highlighting almost everything in the scene.  I might have tried somehow to put a single spot light on the bird which would have lightened the childs face enough to give it a different mood, of course lower light would mean it would require a tripod of sturdy surface for a clear shot.<br/> <br/>It might have been easier to possibly have the childs hand reaching into the cage and getting the shot from that angle through the door.</td>', 'This is a very busy picture...a tough one to shoot through the cage.  It appears that you may have used the on board flash highlighting almost everything in the scene.  I might have tried somehow to put a single spot light on the bird which would have lightened the childs face enough to give it a different mood, of course lower light would mean it would require a tripod of sturdy surface for a clear shot. It might have been easier to possibly have the childs hand reaching into the cage and getting the shot from that angle through the door.', '2004-12-23 23:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076057, 129925, 21367, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  The pose and lighting very moody.  Slight desat works well here but I think this would have done well in b/w as well.  Has Rock and Roll all over it but with more class.  One of my picks.</td>', 'I really like this one.  The pose and lighting very moody.  Slight desat works well here but I think this would have done well in b/w as well.  Has Rock and Roll all over it but with more class.  One of my picks.', '2004-12-23 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076067, 129963, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean and sharp photo.  The crop and b/w work well here.  I gave this pretty high marks.  <br/> <br/>A close in crop and highly shrap shot such as this draws the viewer in to study the photo more closely.  The more I study the more distracting the young lady''s hair (about 3 strands) in front of the cat''s face becomes.   Still an excellent shot.</td>', 'Nice, clean and sharp photo.  The crop and b/w work well here.  I gave this pretty high marks.   A close in crop and highly shrap shot such as this draws the viewer in to study the photo more closely.  The more I study the more distracting the young lady''s hair (about 3 strands) in front of the cat''s face becomes.   Still an excellent shot.', '2004-12-23 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076106, 129033, 6172, '<td valign="top">Cage wires are far too distracting</td>', 'Cage wires are far too distracting', '2004-12-24 01:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
