(1076479, 129929, 27845, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit over-exposed...but on the other hand that creates an interestin look...Okay, you get an extra point for sticking out of the crowd. NIce way to show the relationship btw man&amp;dog. Good title. Good composition, but I''d have liked to see more of the top of the guy''s head. 8.</td>', 'I think this is a bit over-exposed...but on the other hand that creates an interestin look...Okay, you get an extra point for sticking out of the crowd. NIce way to show the relationship btw man&dog. Good title. Good composition, but I''d have liked to see more of the top of the guy''s head. 8.', '2004-12-24 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076480, 129867, 27845, '<td valign="top">You should have rotated the picture 90° to the right, and then cropped off the bottom, leaving but the cat and the guy''s face. 3.</td>', 'You should have rotated the picture 90° to the right, and then cropped off the bottom, leaving but the cat and the guy''s face. 3.', '2004-12-24 12:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
