(1076666, 129341, 9668, '<td valign="top">As stated in this image, God will never leave you. God is man''s last resort, not dogs. <br/> <br/>This is a well done image though. Composition and toning are both excellent, well done.</td>', 'As stated in this image, God will never leave you. God is man''s last resort, not dogs.  This is a well done image though. Composition and toning are both excellent, well done.', '2004-12-24 16:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076669, 128771, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhh, ewwww! How many takes of this did you create? The dog''s mouth is cleaner then ours, but that''s still just horrible. I think the lighting could be a bit better (the reflection off his cheek seems a bit bright, and the dog seems a bit dark).</td>', 'Ohhhhh, ewwww! How many takes of this did you create? The dog''s mouth is cleaner then ours, but that''s still just horrible. I think the lighting could be a bit better (the reflection off his cheek seems a bit bright, and the dog seems a bit dark).', '2004-12-24 16:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
