(1076801, 129706, 31049, '<td valign="top">This is a little blurry. The idea seems original, maybe the composition could be improved a teensy bit.</td>', 'This is a little blurry. The idea seems original, maybe the composition could be improved a teensy bit.', '2004-12-24 22:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076808, 129825, 31049, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very special atmosphere. The hue you chose for the background goes well with the cat''s fur and the model;s skin. What is the background, by the way? Also notable is the crescent reflection in the cat''s eye.</td>', 'This photo has a very special atmosphere. The hue you chose for the background goes well with the cat''s fur and the model;s skin. What is the background, by the way? Also notable is the crescent reflection in the cat''s eye.', '2004-12-24 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076810, 129788, 31049, '<td valign="top">The picture would have gained a lot in my opinion if the tongue would have been in sharp focus. Risky shot.</td>', 'The picture would have gained a lot in my opinion if the tongue would have been in sharp focus. Risky shot.', '2004-12-24 22:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076815, 129898, 31049, '<td valign="top">He has that predator look in his eyes... Are you sure he''s tame?</td>', 'He has that predator look in his eyes... Are you sure he''s tame?', '2004-12-24 23:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076816, 129265, 31049, '<td valign="top">Good work using the strawberry to add some color to this photo. Gread use of the rule of thirds in my opinion.</td>', 'Good work using the strawberry to add some color to this photo. Gread use of the rule of thirds in my opinion.', '2004-12-24 23:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076818, 129631, 31049, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better if there were a little more space between the dog''s nose and that car outside, but I guess it couldn''t be helped. Great work getting the dog to model for you like that. How much do you pay him for a session?</td>', 'I think it would have been better if there were a little more space between the dog''s nose and that car outside, but I guess it couldn''t be helped. Great work getting the dog to model for you like that. How much do you pay him for a session?', '2004-12-24 23:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076821, 129866, 31049, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the challenge title in this one. I especially love the dog''s bored expression.</td>', 'Great interpretation of the challenge title in this one. I especially love the dog''s bored expression.', '2004-12-24 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076823, 129937, 31049, '<td valign="top">Good portrait. As a composition suggestion, I think it would have increased the impact if the girl had a hand on the leather thingy under the horse''s neck.</td>', 'Good portrait. As a composition suggestion, I think it would have increased the impact if the girl had a hand on the leather thingy under the horse''s neck.', '2004-12-24 23:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076827, 129815, 31049, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but maybe there''s a little too much open space?</td>', 'Interesting idea, but maybe there''s a little too much open space?', '2004-12-24 23:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076832, 129963, 31049, '<td valign="top">Touching effect you got there, with both sets of eyes looking in the same direction...</td>', 'Touching effect you got there, with both sets of eyes looking in the same direction...', '2004-12-24 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076833, 129006, 31049, '<td valign="top">Funniest photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge. Great work, except maybe you should have chosen a different color for the girl''s trash can.</td>', 'Funniest photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge. Great work, except maybe you should have chosen a different color for the girl''s trash can.', '2004-12-24 23:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076838, 128770, 31049, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t exactly call this photo "on theme", but it looks good.</td>', 'I wouldn''t exactly call this photo "on theme", but it looks good.', '2004-12-24 23:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076840, 129662, 31049, '<td valign="top">A little too grainy but a good idea nonetheless.</td>', 'A little too grainy but a good idea nonetheless.', '2004-12-24 23:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076841, 129102, 31049, '<td valign="top">I think the title should have read: "Hello Kitty"... Interesting idea.</td>', 'I think the title should have read: "Hello Kitty"... Interesting idea.', '2004-12-24 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076843, 128825, 31049, '<td valign="top">This photo would have been a winner if you''d have managed to remove all traces of water. It would have looked like the fish were floating in midair above your hand.</td>', 'This photo would have been a winner if you''d have managed to remove all traces of water. It would have looked like the fish were floating in midair above your hand.', '2004-12-24 23:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076844, 129341, 31049, '<td valign="top">Great composition and an interesting concept. I like how you chose (?) to hide the man''s face and emphasize the dog''s. Definitely top ten.</td>', 'Great composition and an interesting concept. I like how you chose (?) to hide the man''s face and emphasize the dog''s. Definitely top ten.', '2004-12-24 23:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076846, 129962, 31049, '<td valign="top">It may be that I''m a sucker for kittens, but I like the composition in this one. Don''t know if it''s intended or not, but I love the way the eyelashes complement the kitten''s whiskers.</td>', 'It may be that I''m a sucker for kittens, but I like the composition in this one. Don''t know if it''s intended or not, but I love the way the eyelashes complement the kitten''s whiskers.', '2004-12-24 23:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076877, 129368, 31049, '<td valign="top">A little cropping would have been appropriate. We can see the light on the left!</td>', 'A little cropping would have been appropriate. We can see the light on the left!', '2004-12-25 00:44:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1076884, 129969, 31049, '<td valign="top">YOu can practically hear the purring in this photo... I''d like to see this with a different cropping</td>', 'YOu can practically hear the purring in this photo... I''d like to see this with a different cropping', '2004-12-25 00:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076975, 129941, 30552, '<td valign="top">Is that thing alive!? If so you sure are brave ;)</td>', 'Is that thing alive!? If so you sure are brave ;)', '2004-12-25 08:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076976, 129341, 27845, '<td valign="top">You might enjoy reading Jack London''s short-story ''To build a Fire''. You can find it here: //www.shortstories.computed.net/londonfire.html<br/>I think London''s story reflects what you were trying to suggest.<br/>I like the duotone, it works well with the dirt on the clothes and the texture of the fence and grass. The crop is fine, too. I presume this is staged, so you might have written something else on that sign, referring to the relationship dog-man. ''If you don''t give me food, I have to eat my dog'' ;) Just kidding. Great picture. 8.</td>', 'You might enjoy reading Jack London''s short-story ''To build a Fire''. You can find it here: //www.shortstories.computed.net/londonfire.htmlI think London''s story reflects what you were trying to suggest.I like the duotone, it works well with the dirt on the clothes and the texture of the fence and grass. The crop is fine, too. I presume this is staged, so you might have written something else on that sign, referring to the relationship dog-man. ''If you don''t give me food, I have to eat my dog'' ;) Just kidding. Great picture. 8.', '2004-12-25 08:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076978, 129732, 30552, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh. I love birds.</td>', 'This one made me laugh. I love birds.', '2004-12-25 08:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076979, 129966, 30552, '<td valign="top">I tired to take a photo of my son and his water frog. Wish it would have turned out half as good as your photo, nice job.</td>', 'I tired to take a photo of my son and his water frog. Wish it would have turned out half as good as your photo, nice job.', '2004-12-25 08:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076981, 129759, 27845, '<td valign="top">If your title was ''dog-tired'' it would reflect how I feel. I''m tired of dogs. Don''t think I''ll vote low on you becaue you''ve sent in ''just another'' dog picture. There''s other things that you have to improve on. First, this challenge is about humans and their pets, and the connection between them. I can''t see any connection here, as there''s no person in the picture. And it''s really hard to show the connection between the photographer himself (you) and the subject (your dog).<br/>Let''s have a look at the technical elements. The piece of wood could have been a nice frame for the shot, had you cropped away the carpet below it and the 50px on the right. The direct flash you used caused too bright reflections on the wood, it makes the dog''s eyes look weird and the picture has a ''flat'' look. There are no interesting shadows which might have created a stronger athmosphere which this shot would definately have profited from. I give you a 1.</td>', 'If your title was ''dog-tired'' it would reflect how I feel. I''m tired of dogs. Don''t think I''ll vote low on you becaue you''ve sent in ''just another'' dog picture. There''s other things that you have to improve on. First, this challenge is about humans and their pets, and the connection between them. I can''t see any connection here, as there''s no person in the picture. And it''s really hard to show the connection between the photographer himself (you) and the subject (your dog).Let''s have a look at the technical elements. The piece of wood could have been a nice frame for the shot, had you cropped away the carpet below it and the 50px on the right. The direct flash you used caused too bright reflections on the wood, it makes the dog''s eyes look weird and the picture has a ''flat'' look. There are no interesting shadows which might have created a stronger athmosphere which this shot would definately have profited from. I give you a 1.', '2004-12-25 08:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076982, 129640, 30552, '<td valign="top">Would be ok if it was in focus. The tree makes a nice back ground.</td>', 'Would be ok if it was in focus. The tree makes a nice back ground.', '2004-12-25 08:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076984, 128771, 30552, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh.</td>', 'This one made me laugh.', '2004-12-25 08:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1076986, 128979, 27845, '<td valign="top">Are you kidding me? There''s no pet and no person. A big minus. The composition is boring. The lighting highlights the wrong places. The puppy is out of focus. So are the statue''s hands. I don''t like the colours, you might have tried turning it b&amp;w. 1.</td>', 'Are you kidding me? There''s no pet and no person. A big minus. The composition is boring. The lighting highlights the wrong places. The puppy is out of focus. So are the statue''s hands. I don''t like the colours, you might have tried turning it b&w. 1.', '2004-12-25 08:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077120, 128866, 21636, '<td valign="top">ha</td>', 'ha', '2004-12-25 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077132, 129206, 25735, '<td valign="top">nice shot.congratulation.</td>', 'nice shot.congratulation.', '2004-12-25 15:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077133, 129685, 3214, '<td valign="top">love this, the relationship clear without a human''s face necessary.  Lots of elements but none distracting, hope this does well!</td>', 'love this, the relationship clear without a human''s face necessary.  Lots of elements but none distracting, hope this does well!', '2004-12-25 15:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077137, 129775, 3214, '<td valign="top">Great concept, would have liked to have seen just a little bit of the human''s face, so she didn''t come off looking like "Cousin It" of the Addams Family!</td>', 'Great concept, would have liked to have seen just a little bit of the human''s face, so she didn''t come off looking like "Cousin It" of the Addams Family!', '2004-12-25 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077145, 129732, 25735, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot</td>', 'wonderful shot', '2004-12-25 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077176, 129265, 27845, '<td valign="top">You made a creative use of your LotR figurines. The lighting is good, but I''d have liked to see some more detail on your face, it''s a bit out of focus, too. I like the setup, it gives a good view of you feeding Shelob. 9.<br/>Edit: If it was up to me, you''d get the red one for this challenge.</td>', 'You made a creative use of your LotR figurines. The lighting is good, but I''d have liked to see some more detail on your face, it''s a bit out of focus, too. I like the setup, it gives a good view of you feeding Shelob. 9.Edit: If it was up to me, you''d get the red one for this challenge.', '2004-12-25 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
