(1077446, 129725, 3214, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge', '2004-12-26 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077453, 128681, 3214, '<td valign="top">beautiful relationship shot but not between people and pet</td>', 'beautiful relationship shot but not between people and pet', '2004-12-26 01:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077485, 129524, 22970, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to like about this photograph. First off it meets the challenge to a high degree imo. As far as technique, very well done you have great focus, lighting, and DOF. I like the way your focal point is on the cat. Nice shot and all looks natural. Great Job!</td>', 'There is a lot to like about this photograph. First off it meets the challenge to a high degree imo. As far as technique, very well done you have great focus, lighting, and DOF. I like the way your focal point is on the cat. Nice shot and all looks natural. Great Job!', '2004-12-26 04:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077487, 129937, 22970, '<td valign="top">This photograph would fair well even in an advanced editing challenge. The smooth flesh tones almost looks as if it has been edited for advanced. I guess that is what happens when you take an almost perfectly focused picture. You did a great job on lighting the subjects and the colors are great. So much detail in some areas while achieving smooth effect in others. The only thing I can pick at is the over exposure on the horses nose. Great Job bump to a 8!</td>', 'This photograph would fair well even in an advanced editing challenge. The smooth flesh tones almost looks as if it has been edited for advanced. I guess that is what happens when you take an almost perfectly focused picture. You did a great job on lighting the subjects and the colors are great. So much detail in some areas while achieving smooth effect in others. The only thing I can pick at is the over exposure on the horses nose. Great Job bump to a 8!', '2004-12-26 04:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077489, 129714, 22970, '<td valign="top">A cut picture and it meets the challenge but the lighting is off and the picture is very small, use the max size allowed. Next time you may want to try placing your subjects in an area where the back ground would not be distracting such as about 6 feet from a solid color wall. It will draw the eyes to the subject. I wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'A cut picture and it meets the challenge but the lighting is off and the picture is very small, use the max size allowed. Next time you may want to try placing your subjects in an area where the back ground would not be distracting such as about 6 feet from a solid color wall. It will draw the eyes to the subject. I wish you the best in the challenge.', '2004-12-26 04:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077490, 129937, 29241, '<td valign="top">Snow appears a bit too blue. Horses nose is over exposed but it''s still one of my favorites of the challenge!</td>', 'Snow appears a bit too blue. Horses nose is over exposed but it''s still one of my favorites of the challenge!', '2004-12-26 04:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077491, 128806, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your forward subject is over exposed causing burn out in the highlights and the back subject is to dark. I don''t think the POV is a good angle to capture the mood of this image. Next time try a different angle than a straight on view and improve the lighting. Focus is ok but seems to be off in areas but that may because the picture is so dark. I wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Your forward subject is over exposed causing burn out in the highlights and the back subject is to dark. I don''t think the POV is a good angle to capture the mood of this image. Next time try a different angle than a straight on view and improve the lighting. Focus is ok but seems to be off in areas but that may because the picture is so dark. I wish you the best in the challenge.', '2004-12-26 04:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077494, 129164, 22970, '<td valign="top">Your photograph had potential but its to small. Your focus is good and so is the lighting. I like the sharpness and color. Border is very distracting since the photograph is so small. I wish you could of posted a larger version. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your photograph had potential but its to small. Your focus is good and so is the lighting. I like the sharpness and color. Border is very distracting since the photograph is so small. I wish you could of posted a larger version. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-12-26 04:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077495, 129557, 22970, '<td valign="top">You photograph is very small to judge adequately and the crop does not tell a good story between owner and pet. I see a pair of jeans and one arm holding on to a pet. Next time try to use the max size, it will help in voting. The focus is soft. Good color. Wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'You photograph is very small to judge adequately and the crop does not tell a good story between owner and pet. I see a pair of jeans and one arm holding on to a pet. Next time try to use the max size, it will help in voting. The focus is soft. Good color. Wish you the best in the challenge.', '2004-12-26 04:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077496, 129815, 22970, '<td valign="top">To me you have to much negative space for this shot. A close up would of worked better IMO. The border is distracting and the blue tint does not appeal to this photograph. However your focus is OK. Wish you the best in the challenge.</td>', 'To me you have to much negative space for this shot. A close up would of worked better IMO. The border is distracting and the blue tint does not appeal to this photograph. However your focus is OK. Wish you the best in the challenge.', '2004-12-26 04:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077498, 129476, 22970, '<td valign="top">Focus to soft and the noise is distracting. I think you could of had better lighting and a warmer feel with a colored version.</td>', 'Focus to soft and the noise is distracting. I think you could of had better lighting and a warmer feel with a colored version.', '2004-12-26 05:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077500, 129561, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good focus but you lost a lot of detail in the middle of the cats face because over exposure. Very cute photograph and nice title.</td>', 'Good focus but you lost a lot of detail in the middle of the cats face because over exposure. Very cute photograph and nice title.', '2004-12-26 05:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
