(1077676, 129710, 30608, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I think you missed the challenge, as I only see a picture of a dog.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I think you missed the challenge, as I only see a picture of a dog.', '2004-12-26 09:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077678, 129579, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this certainly meets the challenge.  I would have cropped much tighter though as the window is distracting.  I think if you had shown only the dog''s and childs faces, it would have been more powerful.  6</td>', 'I think this certainly meets the challenge.  I would have cropped much tighter though as the window is distracting.  I think if you had shown only the dog''s and childs faces, it would have been more powerful.  6', '2004-12-26 09:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077682, 129026, 18799, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.  This was almost a very good photograph, but as it is, it''s just a snapshot.  Let me explain.  I think a photograph is something that you or others would hang on the wall, or in paging through an album or book, would pause to look at whereas a snapshot is something that the family would enjoy, but probably wouldn''t hang on the wall. Having said that, I realize that this was one moment in time and you had to take it.  The reason that it isn''t a good "photograph" (in my opinion) is that there is clutter in the background against the wall, some clutter on the carpet and the photo isn''t level.  If those issues were not so prominant, I would give this picture an 8 or 9 becuase there are things that I really like here such as the interaction between the child and the dog and the natural lighting on the childs face.   As is, I''ll have to give it a 6.</td>', 'Returning for comments.  This was almost a very good photograph, but as it is, it''s just a snapshot.  Let me explain.  I think a photograph is something that you or others would hang on the wall, or in paging through an album or book, would pause to look at whereas a snapshot is something that the family would enjoy, but probably wouldn''t hang on the wall. Having said that, I realize that this was one moment in time and you had to take it.  The reason that it isn''t a good "photograph" (in my opinion) is that there is clutter in the background against the wall, some clutter on the carpet and the photo isn''t level.  If those issues were not so prominant, I would give this picture an 8 or 9 becuase there are things that I really like here such as the interaction between the child and the dog and the natural lighting on the childs face.   As is, I''ll have to give it a 6.', '2004-12-26 10:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077683, 129451, 18799, '<td valign="top">The photo should be larger.  If the cat''s face was in focus, this would have gotten a high score from me.  Unfortunately, it''s not.   4</td>', 'The photo should be larger.  If the cat''s face was in focus, this would have gotten a high score from me.  Unfortunately, it''s not.   4', '2004-12-26 10:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077685, 129033, 18799, '<td valign="top">The compositon is really cluttered.  It took me awhile to find the bird.  Also, the bird is cut in half, not a good thing.  If is was up close to her face, this would have been a good photo.</td>', 'The compositon is really cluttered.  It took me awhile to find the bird.  Also, the bird is cut in half, not a good thing.  If is was up close to her face, this would have been a good photo.', '2004-12-26 10:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077730, 129664, 5354, '<td valign="top">Whatch the shadows - lighting from on camera flash is a little harsh. You can buy cheap little slave flashes which will fill in around the subject for this, Or use something to reflect the flash up onto the ceiling (white card)</td>', 'Whatch the shadows - lighting from on camera flash is a little harsh. You can buy cheap little slave flashes which will fill in around the subject for this, Or use something to reflect the flash up onto the ceiling (white card)', '2004-12-26 11:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
