(1077941, 129720, 20023, '<td valign="top">This photograph seems too busy to me, with all the tree limbs and such.  Try framing the subjects closer.  Also, had the dogs been on a inside track between the men, this would have brought the subject of the photo to a more centralized region.</td>', 'This photograph seems too busy to me, with all the tree limbs and such.  Try framing the subjects closer.  Also, had the dogs been on a inside track between the men, this would have brought the subject of the photo to a more centralized region.', '2004-12-26 17:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077942, 129645, 6520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful African Grey 10</td>', 'Beautiful African Grey 10', '2004-12-26 17:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077944, 129026, 20023, '<td valign="top">The play of light in this scene lends itself to shillouettes.  Try to line up the shot for a shillouette next time, thus with less detail in the faces of the subjects.  Great start!</td>', 'The play of light in this scene lends itself to shillouettes.  Try to line up the shot for a shillouette next time, thus with less detail in the faces of the subjects.  Great start!', '2004-12-26 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077945, 129632, 20023, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, but try lighting the scene from multiple angles and using a flash that''s far off the axis of the lens.  That way you can reduce the "green eye" in the cat and (though it doesn''t apply in this case) the red eye in humans.</td>', 'I really like this one, but try lighting the scene from multiple angles and using a flash that''s far off the axis of the lens.  That way you can reduce the "green eye" in the cat and (though it doesn''t apply in this case) the red eye in humans.', '2004-12-26 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077947, 129033, 20023, '<td valign="top">The idea for this one is great!, but it seems to me that the use of a flash is a problem in this photo.  You don''t want the front bars of the cage to get too much in the way, so you''d like them to be in shadow.  Perhaps working with the natural light of the scene would have been the way to go.</td>', 'The idea for this one is great!, but it seems to me that the use of a flash is a problem in this photo.  You don''t want the front bars of the cage to get too much in the way, so you''d like them to be in shadow.  Perhaps working with the natural light of the scene would have been the way to go.', '2004-12-26 17:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077948, 129006, 20023, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2004-12-26 17:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077950, 129968, 20023, '<td valign="top">the long shadows work well with this.  Great time of day to shoot!</td>', 'the long shadows work well with this.  Great time of day to shoot!', '2004-12-26 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077962, 129451, 30818, '<td valign="top">Too Small and the cat is blurred</td>', 'Too Small and the cat is blurred', '2004-12-26 17:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077963, 129757, 30818, '<td valign="top">a little burry, but great shot!</td>', 'a little burry, but great shot!', '2004-12-26 17:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1077970, 129867, 30818, '<td valign="top">I love how you took the picture yourself :)</td>', 'I love how you took the picture yourself :)', '2004-12-26 17:47:32.000000', NULL, 1);
