(1079160, 129164, 23141, '<td valign="top">Likes:  the composition, the white border, the expression on the dog''s face.<br/>Dislikes:  the blue frame (maybe black?), the title (a bit confused by the pronouns).<br/> <br/>Think the image could have been larger, but it''s a good capture regardless!</td>', 'Likes:  the composition, the white border, the expression on the dog''s face.Dislikes:  the blue frame (maybe black?), the title (a bit confused by the pronouns). Think the image could have been larger, but it''s a good capture regardless!', '2004-12-27 18:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1079163, 129631, 23141, '<td valign="top">Likes:  the familiarity, the emotion, the use of b&amp;w.<br/>Dislikes:  the distracting garage and truck out the window, the too-tight crop (would like to see more dog)<br/> <br/>Overall a nice image with a home-y feeling.</td>', 'Likes:  the familiarity, the emotion, the use of b&w.Dislikes:  the distracting garage and truck out the window, the too-tight crop (would like to see more dog) Overall a nice image with a home-y feeling.', '2004-12-27 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1079264, 129937, 10818, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph,  Pretty horse and cute kid, nice DOF.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph,  Pretty horse and cute kid, nice DOF.', '2004-12-27 20:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1079289, 129926, 25218, '<td valign="top">Cute dogs! Nice composition, but it''s dark &amp; a different background would have helped Grover.. I mean, the left dog not get so lost. Great capture!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-15 18:28:10.</i></td>', 'Cute dogs! Nice composition, but it''s dark & a different background would have helped Grover.. I mean, the left dog not get so lost. Great capture!', '2004-12-27 20:33:26.000000', '2005-01-15 18:28:10.000000', 1),
(1079294, 129631, 26695, '<td valign="top">This dog is adorable.. I bet he''s even sweeter from the front. Shame you didn''t have a person in it but the point of the picture would have been lost then, wouldn''t it? The missing person, or pet, can make a powerful statement as well. 10</td>', 'This dog is adorable.. I bet he''s even sweeter from the front. Shame you didn''t have a person in it but the point of the picture would have been lost then, wouldn''t it? The missing person, or pet, can make a powerful statement as well. 10', '2004-12-27 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1079299, 129645, 23141, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but looks like you used way too much NeatImage (or some filter).  The soft look is appealing in its way, but you''ve lost some of the detail in the feathers.  The lighting is really nice, though.</td>', 'A nice picture, but looks like you used way too much NeatImage (or some filter).  The soft look is appealing in its way, but you''ve lost some of the detail in the feathers.  The lighting is really nice, though.', '2004-12-27 20:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1079300, 129937, 23141, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but looks like you used way too much NeatImage (or some filter).  The soft look is appealing in its way, but you''ve lost the detail in the fur of the horse''s face.</td>', 'A nice picture, but looks like you used way too much NeatImage (or some filter).  The soft look is appealing in its way, but you''ve lost the detail in the fur of the horse''s face.', '2004-12-27 20:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
