(1079308, 129952, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the dog picture, but you''ve got jaggies on my screen.  Would also like to see this picture with a looser crop on the dog and a higher aperture to get both subjects in focus.</td>', 'Nice take on the dog picture, but you''ve got jaggies on my screen.  Would also like to see this picture with a looser crop on the dog and a higher aperture to get both subjects in focus.', '2004-12-27 21:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
