(1080635, 129557, 16648, '<td valign="top">way too small. check fhtr tutorials on this site for how to size an entry for submission.<br/> <br/>the composition is very bad - basic rule: unless it adds to the pic (the meaning, etc) then remove it. So we have here pasrt of  a person...a hand...some grass...not sure what the intent was....</td>', 'way too small. check fhtr tutorials on this site for how to size an entry for submission. the composition is very bad - basic rule: unless it adds to the pic (the meaning, etc) then remove it. So we have here pasrt of  a person...a hand...some grass...not sure what the intent was....', '2004-12-28 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
