(1080844, 129316, 20042, '<td valign="top">This one was taken when I stumbled onto an agility challenge for a local dog club. <a href="//www.jumpingchollas.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.jumpingchollas.com</a> <br/> <br/>Some of these dogs are amazing. They are so fast I had a hard time getting any shots.</td>', 'This one was taken when I stumbled onto an agility challenge for a local dog club. //www.jumpingchollas.com  Some of these dogs are amazing. They are so fast I had a hard time getting any shots.', '2004-12-29 01:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1080860, 129524, 19503, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to say that I''m surprised this didn''t do better. <br/> <br/>I love the contrast of the cat''s soft fur with the old mans wrinkly face in the background. I don''t find the softer focus on the man distracting at all... It makes me feel like he''s just deeper into dreamland than the cat :)<br/> <br/>The light is really sweet, I can feel the coziness in the light too. I even think I can hear the cat purring. Good Job!</td>', 'Just wanted to say that I''m surprised this didn''t do better.  I love the contrast of the cat''s soft fur with the old mans wrinkly face in the background. I don''t find the softer focus on the man distracting at all... It makes me feel like he''s just deeper into dreamland than the cat :) The light is really sweet, I can feel the coziness in the light too. I even think I can hear the cat purring. Good Job!', '2004-12-29 01:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
