(1080990, 129964, 30115, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments guys! it was a natural moment i captured not a forced one or a pose...miagi was and is always happy to see his daddy come home that he just constantly wanting to be held and loved :) when he is upside down it looks like he smiles and his little teeth stick out making him look like a vampire kitty i guess lol i am not appreciative however of how this photo could receive 1''s and 2''s and 3''s in the amount it did. I also find it ironic that a photo that did so well for me got that type of scoring. hmm dunno. alot of people were disgusted by the pics submitted for this challenge and chose to not vote or just give out low votes. my thinking is...i don''t enjoy doing yellow or find mechanical interesting either but i still look at everyone''s pics and vote on how i feel about them. i guess some people don''t agree. it helps people learn and it helps the turnout. either way im very very happy to receive the 42''nd place! lol i''ve never done that well!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-29 03:23:09.</i></td>', 'thanks for all the comments guys! it was a natural moment i captured not a forced one or a pose...miagi was and is always happy to see his daddy come home that he just constantly wanting to be held and loved :) when he is upside down it looks like he smiles and his little teeth stick out making him look like a vampire kitty i guess lol i am not appreciative however of how this photo could receive 1''s and 2''s and 3''s in the amount it did. I also find it ironic that a photo that did so well for me got that type of scoring. hmm dunno. alot of people were disgusted by the pics submitted for this challenge and chose to not vote or just give out low votes. my thinking is...i don''t enjoy doing yellow or find mechanical interesting either but i still look at everyone''s pics and vote on how i feel about them. i guess some people don''t agree. it helps people learn and it helps the turnout. either way im very very happy to receive the 42''nd place! lol i''ve never done that well!', '2004-12-29 03:21:10.000000', '2004-12-29 03:23:09.000000', 0),
(1081003, 129968, 26849, '<td valign="top">To clarify in case you don''t understand this photo. They are pets but not a house pet. The picture is a candid not a snapshot.<br/> <br/>"pet  n. 1. An animal kept for amusement or companionship." There are ducks and geese at this park that are not migrating birds. They live there year around for the enjoyment of the park visitors. Some may even have clipped wings. Some I''ve never seen fly and I''ve been to the park probably over 70 times this year. They are pets (part time as titled).<br/> <br/>I knew the story I wanted to communicate. It took me three trips and I''m sure over a 100 shots to get the CANDID shot of this little girl being kind to the ducks. Not really a snapshot unless you consider photos that a wildlife photographer who waits for the right action to occur is just shooting a snapshot.<br/> <br/></td>', 'To clarify in case you don''t understand this photo. They are pets but not a house pet. The picture is a candid not a snapshot. "pet  n. 1. An animal kept for amusement or companionship." There are ducks and geese at this park that are not migrating birds. They live there year around for the enjoyment of the park visitors. Some may even have clipped wings. Some I''ve never seen fly and I''ve been to the park probably over 70 times this year. They are pets (part time as titled). I knew the story I wanted to communicate. It took me three trips and I''m sure over a 100 shots to get the CANDID shot of this little girl being kind to the ducks. Not really a snapshot unless you consider photos that a wildlife photographer who waits for the right action to occur is just shooting a snapshot. ', '2004-12-29 04:23:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1081032, 129962, 16493, '<td valign="top">About time you got some ribbons too, you have been leting Heida geting them all.<br/>Congratulations on a great image.</td>', 'About time you got some ribbons too, you have been leting Heida geting them all.Congratulations on a great image.', '2004-12-29 05:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
