(1081061, 129925, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and well executed.  A real piece of art!  This should have ribboned!</td>', 'Well thought out and well executed.  A real piece of art!  This should have ribboned!', '2004-12-29 06:41:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1081129, 129825, 27306, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the nice comments and criticism. This was a great Christmas gift.<br/>I agree, the lighting could have been better and I also wish the cat looked straight in her eye, but to tell the truth, he was not very willing to pose and so I had only a few attempts :) nevertheless, we have a very affectionate relationship with him, but the thing is he decides the moments... Great thanks to my elder daughter for posing (she was willing, lol). <br/>I did not add comments at the time of submitting, so here are the details:<br/> <br/>Lighting is fully natural, mid afternoon, east looking window, cloudy but not overcast. I fastened a semi-transparent plastic sheet to the window to get the homogenous backdrop.<br/>Prost processing steps, other than crop and resize were:<br/>- Neat Image to get rid of some noise patterns in the background<br/>- Sepia Toning<br/>- Adjusted Brightness higher a bit<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-29 08:18:15.</i></td>', 'Thanks everybody for the nice comments and criticism. This was a great Christmas gift.I agree, the lighting could have been better and I also wish the cat looked straight in her eye, but to tell the truth, he was not very willing to pose and so I had only a few attempts :) nevertheless, we have a very affectionate relationship with him, but the thing is he decides the moments... Great thanks to my elder daughter for posing (she was willing, lol). I did not add comments at the time of submitting, so here are the details: Lighting is fully natural, mid afternoon, east looking window, cloudy but not overcast. I fastened a semi-transparent plastic sheet to the window to get the homogenous backdrop.Prost processing steps, other than crop and resize were:- Neat Image to get rid of some noise patterns in the background- Sepia Toning- Adjusted Brightness higher a bit', '2004-12-29 07:50:56.000000', '2004-12-29 08:18:15.000000', 0),
