(1081476, 129389, 25787, '<td valign="top">Thank you everybody for all your nice, helpful, and supportive comments.  I am very excited about making the top ten.  This shot was a snapshot, with two unwilling models.  Took in front of a window, just available lite.  If I had a second chance, I would have put a gold reflector on the left side of the photo.  Thanks again.  <br/> <br/>Mike</td>', 'Thank you everybody for all your nice, helpful, and supportive comments.  I am very excited about making the top ten.  This shot was a snapshot, with two unwilling models.  Took in front of a window, just available lite.  If I had a second chance, I would have put a gold reflector on the left side of the photo.  Thanks again.   Mike', '2004-12-29 12:19:38.000000', NULL, 0),
