(1081830, 129510, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice finish for your first entry. Smoky doesn''t look like he is cooperating. I didn''t enter this challenge, because my lighting was horrible. What I did do though is have my daughter put a little peanut butter on the side of her face not in the photo. The dog was very cooperative and candid then.</td>', 'Nice finish for your first entry. Smoky doesn''t look like he is cooperating. I didn''t enter this challenge, because my lighting was horrible. What I did do though is have my daughter put a little peanut butter on the side of her face not in the photo. The dog was very cooperative and candid then.', '2004-12-29 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1082051, 129962, 11769, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Nazgul, you composed a perfect image for the Challenge.  Great modeling job from Heida to. And of course that impossibly cute kitten.</td>', 'Congratulations Nazgul, you composed a perfect image for the Challenge.  Great modeling job from Heida to. And of course that impossibly cute kitten.', '2004-12-29 17:06:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1082129, 129906, 29053, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments in my first entry - photo was taken last minute and I was sure I was out of light but I was happy with the shot since trying to get either a two year old or a dog to cooperate is tough - getting both to stay still is insane.<br/> <br/>I was reluctant to edit the photot since I am not too sure what I am doing in Photoshop - but it has given me some motivation to learn some new tools for basic editing and then move onto the advanced challenges.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments in my first entry - photo was taken last minute and I was sure I was out of light but I was happy with the shot since trying to get either a two year old or a dog to cooperate is tough - getting both to stay still is insane. I was reluctant to edit the photot since I am not too sure what I am doing in Photoshop - but it has given me some motivation to learn some new tools for basic editing and then move onto the advanced challenges.', '2004-12-29 18:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1082273, 129557, 10658, '<td valign="top">I agree with the others, your photo would''ve fared better if it''d been a bit bigger.  Sweet dog :)  I like the emotion conveyed here, the colors could be a little sharper though.  Also, I always thought the focus of the picture should be centered, but when I came to DPC I quickly found that off center subjects are much more pleasing to the eye.  There''s a law of thirds that is really pushed here so that might be something to take into consideration.  All in all I think you and I did pretty well for our first submissions! :)  Good luck next time!</td>', 'I agree with the others, your photo would''ve fared better if it''d been a bit bigger.  Sweet dog :)  I like the emotion conveyed here, the colors could be a little sharper though.  Also, I always thought the focus of the picture should be centered, but when I came to DPC I quickly found that off center subjects are much more pleasing to the eye.  There''s a law of thirds that is really pushed here so that might be something to take into consideration.  All in all I think you and I did pretty well for our first submissions! :)  Good luck next time!', '2004-12-29 20:13:33.000000', NULL, 0),
