(1082810, 129645, 24413, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their comments! Taking photos of animals is not easy and I am pleased with my entry.  I''m also pleased with how far I have come in the 6 months I have been entering challenges.  I''m really learning a lot about lighting and composition.  And this result also proves it doesn''t take an expensive and fancy camera to create great photos!</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their comments! Taking photos of animals is not easy and I am pleased with my entry.  I''m also pleased with how far I have come in the 6 months I have been entering challenges.  I''m really learning a lot about lighting and composition.  And this result also proves it doesn''t take an expensive and fancy camera to create great photos!', '2004-12-30 08:41:49.000000', NULL, 0),
