(1083592, 129706, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, a good start in DPC =). It''s all a learning experience, learning to be a better photographer. Your aim is straight on here.</td>', 'I like this shot, a good start in DPC =). It''s all a learning experience, learning to be a better photographer. Your aim is straight on here.', '2004-12-30 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
