(1091429, 129781, 4226, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club !!<br/> <br/>This is very cute capture and totally reflects the love. A very nice expression on the subject. I like the angle of this shot and the way Roxanne reaches to the kids face. A very loving shot indeed.<br/> <br/>As for technical details, I would agree with other commentors that this looks like a snapshot. the background is distracting, a plain and simple background would sure enhance the photo.The yellowish wall in the background mixes up a little with the subjects'' color. <br/> <br/>I think you can improve the picture with a tighter crop on the bottom-left portion which doesn''t serve much as far as the impact from the photo goes. This should balance the areas covered in the photograph by the two subjects.<br/> <br/>Overall, you have a very cute capture here.<br/> <br/>-Gaurawa<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club !! This is very cute capture and totally reflects the love. A very nice expression on the subject. I like the angle of this shot and the way Roxanne reaches to the kids face. A very loving shot indeed. As for technical details, I would agree with other commentors that this looks like a snapshot. the background is distracting, a plain and simple background would sure enhance the photo.The yellowish wall in the background mixes up a little with the subjects'' color.  I think you can improve the picture with a tighter crop on the bottom-left portion which doesn''t serve much as far as the impact from the photo goes. This should balance the areas covered in the photograph by the two subjects. Overall, you have a very cute capture here. -Gaurawa', '2005-01-04 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
